    "description": "Lay Healer Base 4.4 - Muscle Mastery. Spells for understanding and repairing sprains, muscles, and tendons, transplanting and regenerating muscle/tendon tissue, and reattaching severed limbs. Special Notes: (1) See RMFRP Section 24.1 (p. 75) for more on damage and healing. (2) Some spells on this list require an operation to be effective. These spells have the same name as other healing spells (from the Channeling realm) and the GM may decide that the operation is not required.",
    "spells": [
      {
        "name": "01. Sprain Repair",
        "img": "systems/rmss/assets/default/spell.svg",
        "system": {
          "favorite": false,
          "instant": false,
          "level": 1,
          "area_of_effect": "1 target",
          "duration": "P",
          "range": "touch",
          "type": "U",
          "subType": "-",
          "attack_table": "",
          "skillName": "",
          "description": "Allows caster to repair (not replace) one sprain. Requires a one hour operation."
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "02. Muscle/Tendon Lore",
        "img": "systems/rmss/assets/default/spell.svg",
